php script
via a pg_pconnect connection. I run the loop 1000 times and get the time =
taken
to perform the whole loop and then divy the time by 1000 to get the =
average time
per query. (The Celeron can finish with 1000 in 1/3 the time the PIII =
takes to
perform 10)

