There is a max. tuple length of 8KB in PostgreSQL 7.0.3.

This limitation has been removed in ver. 7.1, which will be released =
soon.

My advise is too use PostgreSQL 7.1RC2, which is very stable, to get
around this problem.

Poul L. Christiansen

