> Ahmed Moustafa wrote:
>> I did the test by hand and here is the output:
>>=20
>> bash-2.03# echo "int main() { return 0; }"  >conftest.c
>> bash-2.03# gcc -o conftest conftest.c -lz -lresolv -lgen -lnsl =
-lsocket -ldl
>> -lm
>> bash-2.03# ./conftest
>> ld.so.1: ./conftest: fatal: libz.so: open failed: No such file or =
directory
